        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3714, 3\" Traditional Rope End Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMeasuring 3 inches c.c., the Rope Cabinet Pull with Clover Ends has traditional style with something more. Often times, traditional cabinet pulls are plain, but this handle made by RK International will be sure to bring a touch of beauty to any space. It is available in 5 finishes including oil rubbed bronze (pictured right), satin nickel, and antique english.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3714 Rope Cabinet Pull with Clover Mounts:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
